        ["Video 8 menit ke atas: judul dan kanal dikirim ke youtube.com untuk mencari daftar lagunya"] = "Videos of 8 minutes or more: the title and channel are sent to youtube.com to look up the track list",
        ["Sambungkan HP, notifikasi, dan kamera. Mulai dari Panduan sambung HP."] = "Connect your phone, notifications and camera. Start with the phone connection guide.",
