        ["Musik tetap tampil di layar penuh"] = "Keep music visible in fullscreen",
        ["Lagu dan liriknya muncul di atas game borderless; island tidak bisa diklik supaya permainan tidak terganggu"] = "The song and lyrics appear over borderless games; the island ignores clicks so the game is not disturbed",
