        ["Wishlist otomatis (ekstensi browser)"] = "Automatic Wishlist (browser extension)", ["Panduan pemasangan"] = "Setup guide", ["Ekstensi tersambung"] = "Extension connected", ["Belum tersambung: Wishlist tetap bisa diisi manual"] = "Not connected: the Wishlist can still be filled in by hand",
        ["Terima info produk dari ekstensi"] = "Accept product info from the extension", ["Hanya dari browsermu ke ZaxLet di PC ini (127.0.0.1); tidak ada yang dikirim ke internet"] = "Only from your browser to ZaxLet on this PC (127.0.0.1); nothing is sent to the internet",
        ["Sarankan simpan ke Wishlist"] = "Suggest saving to the Wishlist", ["Saat link produk yang baru dikenali disalin, pill menawarkannya sekali"] = "When a newly recognised product link is copied, the pill offers it once", ["Token ekstensi"] = "Extension token",
        ["Produk dikenali: {0} · klik untuk simpan ke Wishlist"] = "Product recognised: {0} · click to save to the Wishlist", ["Panduan: isi otomatis dari browser"] = "Guide: fill in automatically from the browser",
        ["Pasang ekstensi di browser"] = "Install the browser extension", ["Hubungkan dengan token"] = "Connect with the token", ["Cara memakainya"] = "How to use it",
        ["Buka folder ekstensi"] = "Open the extension folder", ["Salin chrome://extensions"] = "Copy chrome://extensions", ["Salin token"] = "Copy token", ["Menunggu ekstensi"] = "Waiting for the extension",
        ["Penerima mati: nyalakan di Pengaturan > Alat"] = "Receiver off: turn it on in Settings > Tools", ["{0} halaman produk diterima"] = "{0} product page(s) received", ["Belum ada halaman produk diterima"] = "No product page received yet",
        ["Supaya cukup menyalin link dan semuanya terisi, ekstensi kecil di browsermu membaca halaman produk yang kamu buka (browsermu sendiri, jadi toko yang menolak program lain tetap terbaca) dan mengirimnya ke ZaxLet di PC ini saja. Di Chrome, Edge, atau Brave: buka halaman ekstensi, nyalakan Mode pengembang, klik Muat yang belum dipaket, lalu pilih folder yang dibuka tombol di bawah."] = "So that copying the link is enough to fill everything in, a small extension in your browser reads the product pages you open (your own browser, so shops that refuse other programs are still readable) and sends them only to ZaxLet on this PC. In Chrome, Edge or Brave: open the extensions page, turn on Developer mode, click Load unpacked, then choose the folder opened by the button below.",
        ["Klik ikon ekstensi ZaxLet Wishlist di browser (ikon puzzle, lalu ZaxLet Wishlist). Halaman pengaturannya terbuka: tempel token dari tombol di bawah, lalu klik Simpan dan tes sambungan."] = "Click the ZaxLet Wishlist extension icon in the browser (the puzzle icon, then ZaxLet Wishlist). Its settings page opens: paste the token from the button below, then click Save and test the connection.",
        ["Buka halaman produk di toko seperti biasa dan tunggu sebentar. Salin linknya (Ctrl+L lalu Ctrl+C). Pill menawarkan Produk dikenali: klik untuk menyimpannya. Atau buka tab Wishlist dan klik + Tempel link. Judul, harga, dan gambar terisi sendiri. Bila halaman bukan produk, tidak ada yang dikirim."] = "Open a product page in the shop as usual and wait a moment. Copy its link (Ctrl+L then Ctrl+C). The pill offers Product recognised: click to save it. Or open the Wishlist tab and click + Paste link. Title, price and picture fill in by themselves. If the page is not a product, nothing is sent.",
        ["Pasang di Firefox"] = "Install in Firefox", ["Atau pasang di Chrome, Edge, Brave"] = "Or install in Chrome, Edge, Brave", ["Salin about:debugging"] = "Copy about:debugging",
        ["Ekstensi kecil di browsermu membaca halaman produk yang kamu buka (browsermu sendiri, jadi toko yang menolak program lain tetap terbaca) dan mengirimnya ke ZaxLet di PC ini saja. Firefox rilis hanya memasang ekstensi yang ditandatangani Mozilla. Untuk mencoba sekarang: buka about:debugging, klik Muat Add-on Sementara, lalu pilih manifest.json di folder yang dibuka tombol di bawah (hilang saat Firefox ditutup). Untuk permanen: kirim zaxlet-wishlist.xpi (ada di folder yang sama) ke addons.mozilla.org lewat Developer Hub > Submit a New Add-on > On your own (gratis, ditandatangani dalam beberapa menit), lalu pasang berkas bertanda tangan itu."] = "A small extension in your browser reads the product pages you open (your own browser, so shops that refuse other programs are still readable) and sends them only to ZaxLet on this PC. Release Firefox only installs extensions signed by Mozilla. To try it now: open about:debugging, click Load Temporary Add-on, then pick manifest.json in the folder opened by the button below (it disappears when Firefox closes). For a permanent install: submit zaxlet-wishlist.xpi (in the same folder) to addons.mozilla.org via Developer Hub > Submit a New Add-on > On your own (free, signed within minutes), then install the signed file.",
        ["Buka halaman ekstensi, nyalakan Mode pengembang, klik Muat yang belum dipaket, lalu pilih folder ekstensi (tombol di langkah sebelumnya membukanya). Tidak perlu tanda tangan. Langkah ini dan langkah Firefox boleh dipilih salah satu."] = "Open the extensions page, turn on Developer mode, click Load unpacked, then choose the extension folder (the button in the previous step opens it). No signature needed. Choose either this step or the Firefox one.",
        ["Klik ikon ekstensi ZaxLet Wishlist di browser (Firefox: menu puzzle, lalu ZaxLet Wishlist). Halaman pengaturannya terbuka. Di Firefox, klik dulu Izinkan akses ke situs. Lalu tempel token dari tombol di bawah, dan klik Simpan dan tes sambungan."] = "Click the ZaxLet Wishlist extension icon in the browser (Firefox: the puzzle menu, then ZaxLet Wishlist). Its settings page opens. In Firefox, first click Allow access to sites. Then paste the token from the button below and click Save and test the connection.",
        ["Gaya notifikasi"] = "Notification style", ["Tenang"] = "Quiet", ["Seimbang"] = "Balanced", ["Lengkap"] = "Full", ["Kustom"] = "Custom",
        ["Tenang: hanya yang penting. Seimbang: popup umum. Lengkap: semua popup dan widget. Sakelar satu per satu ada di halaman Island dan Fokus"] = "Quiet: only what matters. Balanced: common popups. Full: every popup and widget. The individual switches are on the Island and Focus pages",
        ["Sumber musik"] = "Music sources", ["Abaikan musik dari aplikasi"] = "Ignore music from apps",
        ["Isi nama aplikasi dipisah koma, mis. discord, zoom; island tidak akan menampilkannya"] = "Enter app names separated by commas, e.g. discord, zoom; the island will not show them",
        ["Ikut Windows"] = "Follow Windows", ["Pintasan buka island"] = "Open-island shortcut", ["Mis. ctrl+alt+space; tekan lagi untuk menutup. Kosongkan untuk mematikan"] = "E.g. ctrl+alt+space; press again to close. Leave empty to turn off",
        ["\nKlik: salin · seret: ke aplikasi lain"] = "\nClick: copy · drag: into another app", ["Volume aplikasi"] = "App volume", ["Hanya perangkat keluaran suara utama"] = "Default output device only", ["Belum ada aplikasi yang mengeluarkan suara."] = "No app is playing sound yet.", ["Akhiri"] = "End", ["Kotak kedua (Codex / Antigravity)"] = "Second box (Codex / Antigravity)", ["Isi kotak kedua"] = "Second box content", ["Antigravity dibaca dari aplikasinya yang sedang terbuka"] = "Antigravity is read from its running app", ["buka Antigravity"] = "open Antigravity", ["kuota tidak ditemukan di respons Antigravity"] = "no quota in the Antigravity response", ["Klik kanan lagi"] = "Right-click again",
        ["Tidur? Tekan Enter sekali lagi"] = "Sleep? Press Enter once more", ["Tema Windows: gelap"] = "Windows theme: dark", ["Tema Windows: terang"] = "Windows theme: light",
        ["{0} nyala"] = "{0} on", ["{0} mati"] = "{0} off", ["{0}: tidak tersedia atau izin ditolak"] = "{0}: unavailable or permission denied",
        ["Hook Claude Code"] = "Claude Code hook", ["Pill memberi tahu saat Claude selesai atau menunggu izin. Salin, lalu tempel ke \"hooks\" di ~/.claude/settings.json (ZaxLet tidak menulis ke sana)"] = "The pill tells you when Claude finishes or waits for permission. Copy it, then paste into \"hooks\" in ~/.claude/settings.json (ZaxLet does not write there)", ["Salin hook"] = "Copy hook",
        ["Webhook lokal"] = "Local webhook", ["Skrip atau alat di PC ini bisa menampilkan pesan di pill; salin contoh perintahnya"] = "Scripts or tools on this PC can show a message in the pill; copy the example command", ["Salin contoh"] = "Copy example",
        ["Pil jam kecil saat menyingkir"] = "Small clock pill when moving away", ["Bukan hilang total: tetap tampil sebagai jam kecil (atau jam dan tanggal)"] = "Not gone entirely: stays as a small clock (or clock and date)", ["Jam dan tanggal"] = "Clock and date",
        ["Bentuk island"] = "Island shape", ["Notch: bahu cekung di kiri dan kanan seperti takik layar. Dynamic: kapsul bulat"] = "Notch: concave shoulders on both sides like a screen notch. Dynamic: a round capsule", ["Notch"] = "Notch", ["Dynamic"] = "Dynamic",
        ["Overlay performa saat main"] = "Performance overlay while gaming", ["Kapan tampil"] = "When to show", ["Game"] = "Game", ["Selalu"] = "Always", ["Mati"] = "Off",
        ["Game: otomatis saat aplikasi layar penuh atau borderless di depan. Selalu: terus tampil. Ketik \"perf\" di Aksi cepat untuk menyalakan atau mematikan sesaat. Mati = tidak membaca sensor sama sekali"] = "Game: automatic while a fullscreen or borderless app is in front. Always: stays on. Type \"perf\" in Quick action to toggle it for now. Off = no sensors are read at all",
        ["Tampilkan juga di tab Monitor island"] = "Also show in the island's Monitor tab", ["Menggantikan daftar proses teratas dengan metrik yang dipilih di bawah, satu baris per metrik. Ukuran island tidak berubah"] = "Replaces the top-processes list with the metrics chosen below, one line per metric. The island size does not change",
        ["Inti CPU tersibuk"] = "Busiest CPU core", ["Beban bus memori GPU"] = "GPU memory bus load", ["Status daya GPU (P-state)"] = "GPU power state (P-state)", ["Pembatasan GPU (daya/suhu)"] = "GPU throttling (power/thermal)", ["Kipas GPU"] = "GPU fan",
        ["Disk baca/tulis"] = "Disk read/write", ["Jaringan unduh/unggah"] = "Network down/up", ["FPS (game di depan)"] = "FPS (game in front)", ["Daya CPU (paket)"] = "CPU power (package)", ["Tegangan CPU"] = "CPU voltage", ["Tegangan GPU"] = "GPU voltage",
        ["FPS dibaca dari peristiwa Present DirectX (cara PresentMon), tanpa menyuntik game. Windows mewajibkan izin: lihat dua baris di bawah daftar ini"] = "FPS is read from DirectX Present events (the PresentMon way) without injecting into the game. Windows requires permission: see the two rows below this list",
        ["Dibaca dari LibreHardwareMonitor (jalankan sebagai admin, nyalakan Options > Remote Web Server). Tanpa itu tampil \"butuh LHM\"; ZaxLet sengaja tidak membawa driver sensor"] = "Read from LibreHardwareMonitor (run as admin, enable Options > Remote Web Server). Without it shows \"needs LHM\"; ZaxLet deliberately ships no sensor driver",
        ["Dari sensor energi (RAPL) Windows; tidak ada di semua PC"] = "From the Windows energy sensor (RAPL); not on every PC",
        ["FPS: izinkan sekali (UAC)"] = "FPS: allow once (UAC)", ["Proses pembantu admin kecil membaca peristiwa Present; berlaku sampai ZaxLet ditutup. Pilih metrik FPS dulu"] = "A small admin helper reads Present events; lasts until ZaxLet closes. Select the FPS metric first",
        ["FPS butuh izin admin. Coba lagi dan pilih Ya di jendela Windows."] = "FPS needs admin permission. Try again and choose Yes in the Windows prompt.", ["Izinkan FPS"] = "Allow FPS", ["Kamera virtual butuh izin sekali. Nyalakan lagi dan pilih Ya di jendela Windows."] = "The virtual camera needs permission once. Turn it on again and choose Yes in the Windows prompt.", ["Tanpa izin firewall, HP bisa gagal tersambung. Matikan lalu nyalakan lagi untuk mencoba, atau pilih Izinkan saat Windows bertanya."] = "Without firewall permission the phone may fail to connect. Turn it off and on again to retry, or choose Allow when Windows asks.", ["Nyalakan Lokasi dan \"Izinkan aplikasi desktop mengakses lokasi\" di jendela Windows yang terbuka, lalu tekan Deteksi sekarang."] = "Turn on Location and \"Let desktop apps access your location\" in the Windows window that opened, then press Detect now.", ["Folder ZaxLet butuh izin admin untuk pembaruan: pilih Ya di jendela Windows."] = "The ZaxLet folder needs admin permission to update: choose Yes in the Windows prompt.", ["Tegangan butuh LibreHardwareMonitor: jalankan sebagai admin, lalu Options > Remote Web Server."] = "Voltage needs LibreHardwareMonitor: run it as admin, then Options > Remote Web Server.",
        ["Izinkan"] = "Allow", ["Aktif"] = "Active", ["FPS: izin permanen tanpa UAC"] = "FPS: permanent permission without UAC", ["Salin perintah, jalankan di CMD sebagai administrator, lalu sign out dan masuk lagi ke Windows sekali"] = "Copy the command, run it in an administrator CMD, then sign out and back in to Windows once", ["Salin perintah"] = "Copy command",
        ["Performa"] = "Performance", ["Overlay nyala"] = "Overlay on", ["Overlay mati"] = "Overlay off",
